        "line": 15,
        "excerpt": "When `userId` changes the effect re-runs, but `user` is never cleared first. Because `user` is still non-null, the `if (!user) return <p>Loading…</p>` branch is skipped and the previous user's name and bio remain visible during the in-flight request. Adding `setUser(null)` along…",
